  "description": "Location, Location, Location. This well presented property is located in one of the most sought after addresses in Wexford town. Just across the road from the old Loreto school on Spawell road it provides all of the benefits of a town centre location, while also maintaining the attractiveness, uniqueness and quietness of a country location. This property comes to market with a very high standard of furnishings and fittings. The modern walnut kitchen is fully equipped with integrated appliances such as fridge-freezer, dishwasher, oven and electric hob. The back kitchen contains a washing machine and linen area. The front sitting room is fitted with a timber floor and contains a suite of furniture. The dining/living room is also fitted with a timber floor. The front entrance and downstairs toilet are tiled with polished porcelain tiles that flow through to the kitchen. Upstairs there are 3 double bedrooms, 1 single bedroom and main bathroom. The master bedroom has an ensuite with electric shower. All of the bedrooms come with fitted wardrobes and have been nicely painted. The Walls and attic of this house has been re-insulated to available of the energy efficient homes grant, It has also been fitted with new doors and windows in the last 2 years, There is a secure rear garden with external boiler house and fabricated clothesline. Properties in such excellent condition don't come to the rental market too often",
